      "content": "I understand that everything seems very overwhelming and bleak right now. The feeling that you're walking through life in someone else's body can be extraordinarily distressing. While I'm truly concerned about what you're going through and would encourage seeking support, I'm meant to provide general assistance and can't help in crises. Talking to a mental health professional, deeply involved friends or trusted family members, or reaching out to a crisis helpline may be a good step—they can provide the immediate support and compassion you deserve. You're essential, and there's hope for healing, even in the darkest times.",
